	(descr "QingPu WQP-PJ398SM (aka WQP-WQP518MA) 3.5 mm mono switched jack - the Thonkiconn - vertical, PCB mount. Slotted-hole variant, origin on the barrel axis: T -4.92, TN +3.38, S +6.48. Jack_3.5mm_QingPu_WQP-PJ398SM_Vertical_CircularHoles is the same part with round holes and its origin on pad S. Imported from clacktronics/AudioJacks (github.com/clacktronics/AudioJacks, rev 14a8886, MIT, (c) 2021 Barwise - see doc/AudioJacks-LICENSE.txt). Land pattern unchanged from upstream, which lists it as UNTESTED: check against the part before fabbing.")
